{"title":"Hero X Demon Queen","synopsis":"Ratu iblis dikalahkan oleh anjing peliharaanku… Aku hanya ingin hidup tenang di pedesaan, tapi secara tak sengaja aku datang ke dunia lain, bertahan hidup di desa pemula hingga menjadi makhluk legendaris, bahkan ratu iblis yang menguasai dunia pun dikalahkan oleh anjing peliharaanku. Sejak itu, ratu iblis tinggal di rumahku, dan petualangan di dunia lain pun dimulai.","alternative_title":"勇者X女魔王, Yongzhe X Nv Mowang, Yǒngzhě X Nǚ Mówáng, Hero X Demon Queen","author":"拾部","artist":"拾部","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Isekai"],"chapters":[{"id":"af67859d-0820-4ae0-b098-4edf02b4e3d2","number":"177","title":"Chapter 177","date":"2025-10-14","images":[]},{"id":"c55406ea-3349-458b-a25a-875d77a2b6bf","number":"176","title":"Chapter 176","date":"2025-10-14","images":[]},{"id":"e40a8c77-5d19-406e-8385-3ac75085297d","number":"175","title":"Chapter 175","date":"2025-09-29","images":[]},{"id":"2954a164-aa1d-40d1-a0fa-c93773292917","number":"174","title":"Chapter 174","date":"2025-09-29","images":[]},{"id":"2990c378-04e3-4dba-9688-090a927bf3a2","number":"173","title":"Chapter 173","date":"2025-09-01","images":[]},{"id":"1f3a8a5a-7c7e-4951-ba40-e33420f39f73","number":"172","title":"Chapter 172","date":"2025-08-31","images":[]},{"id":"7a7529fd-5bb0-4524-8161-d68d20a79e6e","number":"170","title":"Chapter 170","date":"2025-08-14","images":[]},{"id":"35b5fa4a-bff9-4c76-b711-4aa16001f516","number":"169","title":"Chapter 169","date":"2025-08-14","images":[]},{"id":"1de29919-4c76-44bb-89ec-d225f115fa6e","number":"168","title":"Chapter 168","date":"2025-08-08","images":[]},{"id":"1487a0c5-f42a-4efe-8c62-6ec3900af0f2","number":"167","title":"Chapter 167","date":"2025-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"a3940358-75e6-49fe-9eca-695330690539","number":"166","title":"Chapter 166","date":"2025-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"de925b3f-7826-408b-993d-8ba3b9656dae","number":"165","title":"Chapter 165","date":"2025-07-17","images":[]},{"id":"7d01f722-2591